    {
      "id": "playstyle",
      "title": {
        "en": "Playstyle"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "Mei Lin Move Vs Draw Vs Create Strikes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1027_uni2",
              "name": "Unity of Attack and Defense",
              "cost": 0,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 2,
                "name": "Unity of Attack and Defense II",
                "text": {
                  "en": "Move 2 Basic Card(s) of this unit to hand, then decrease Cost of those cards by 1 for 1 turn until activated."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1027_uni2",
              "name": "Unity of Attack and Defense",
              "cost": 0,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 0,
                "name": "Unity of Attack and Defense",
                "text": {
                  "en": "Draw 2 Basic Card(s) of this unit, then decrease Cost of those cards by 1 for 1 turn until activated."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1027_uni2",
              "name": "Unity of Attack and Defense",
              "cost": 0,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 4,
                "name": "Unity of Attack and Defense IV",
                "text": {
                  "en": "Create 2 Strike card(s). Decrease Cost of those cards by 1."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1027_srt1",
              "name": "Strike",
              "cost": 1,
              "text": {
                "en": "100% Damage."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Mei Lin's Strength is about \"Moving\" her Strike Cards and Playing for 0 Cost\nHer base Unity version only \"Draws\" the Strike Cards\nDrawing is different from Moving, and can only be taken from the Deck\nBut if your Strikes are in your \"Discard\" \"Draw\" can force a \"Reshuffle\"\nOnce your Strikes are in the Deck from Reshuffle, it Draws your Strikes\n\"Move\" transfers the Card directly from zones into Hand\nMei Lin \"Move\" can transfer from \"Deck\" \"Discard and \"Used\" Pile\n\"Move\" counts as Draw, Only if Moving the card from Deck, not Discard/Used\nUnity 4, Creates 2 Strikes that Don't have Exhaust, so they're Permanent\nThey get Added to your deck, Killing Draws\nInstead of Drawing a Unity worth 2 Strikes, you'll Draw Strikes Individually."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Spire Math"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "4 Unity = 4x3 = (12+3) x 1+1 = 16 Hits on 1 spire /Ap = 8\n3 unity = 3x3 = (9+3) x 2 +3 = 25 Hits on 2 Spires /AP = 6.25\n2 Units = 2x3 = (6+3) x 3 + 6 = 33 Hits on 3 Spires /AP = 5.5\n1 Unity = 1 x3 = (3+3) x 4 + 10 = 32 Hits on 4 Spires /AP = 4\nThe Value of 3/4 Spire dupes does increase with Veronica\nBut so does AP Requirement\n2/3 Spire is the sweet spot, just depends on how much AP you can make"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "2/4 Patch notes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Unchanged"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
